# Owner of impord_fverdict/2, with no clauses of its own — a downstream
# fixture supplies the only fact, so the pre-existing "a local clause for an
# imported functor replaces its clause list" behaviour (unchanged by the
# positional-head fix; verified identical on main) cannot confuse the
# assertion.
-module(impord_fact_vocab, [impord_fverdict(OUTCOME, CITES)])
